{
 "file": "earthrover_mini_plus.mdx",
 "units": [
  {
   "id": 0,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 1924,
   "end": 1946,
   "text": "# EarthRover Mini Plus",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 1,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 2159,
   "end": 2352,
   "text": "The EarthRover Mini Plus is a fully open source mobile robot that connects through the cloud using the Frodobots SDK. This lets you control the robot and record datasets for training AI models.",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 2354,
   "end": 2370,
   "text": "## What You Need",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 2372,
   "end": 2384,
   "text": "### Hardware",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 2386,
   "end": 2409,
   "text": "- EarthRover Mini robot",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 2410,
   "end": 2446,
   "text": "- Computer with Python 3.12 or newer",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 6,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 2447,
   "end": 2468,
   "text": "- Internet connection",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 7,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 2470,
   "end": 2502,
   "text": "### Setting Up the Frodobots SDK",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 8,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 2504,
   "end": 2628,
   "text": "The robot needs the [Frodobots SDK](⟦0⟧) running on your computer. Here's how:",
   "tokens": [
    "https://github.com/frodobots-org/earth-rovers-sdk"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 9,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 2630,
   "end": 2662,
   "text": "1. Download and install the SDK:",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 10,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 2793,
   "end": 2813,
   "text": "2. Save Credentials:",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 11,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 2815,
   "end": 2906,
   "text": "Write your .env variables with the SDK API key and bot name provided by the Frodobots team.",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 12,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 3424,
   "end": 3441,
   "text": "3. Start the SDK:",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 13,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 3484,
   "end": 3561,
   "text": "4. Open your web browser and go to ⟦0⟧, then click \"Join\"",
   "tokens": [
    "`http://localhost:8000`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 14,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 3563,
   "end": 3581,
   "text": "The SDK gives you:",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 15,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 3583,
   "end": 3623,
   "text": "- Live video from front and rear cameras",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 16,
   "kind": "quote",
   "start": 3625,
   "end": 3695,
   "text": "> [!IMPORTANT]\n> The SDK must be running before you can use the robot.",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 17,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 3697,
   "end": 3715,
   "text": "## Install LeRobot",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 18,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 3717,
   "end": 3784,
   "text": "Follow our [Installation Guide](⟦0⟧) to install LeRobot.",
   "tokens": [
    "./installation"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 19,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 3786,
   "end": 3879,
   "text": "In addition to the base installation, install the EarthRover Mini with hardware dependencies:",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 20,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 3923,
   "end": 3938,
   "text": "## How It Works",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 21,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 3940,
   "end": 3983,
   "text": "The robot uses the internet to communicate:",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 22,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 3985,
   "end": 4030,
   "text": "- **Movement commands**: Sent through the SDK",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 23,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 4031,
   "end": 4072,
   "text": "- **Camera video**: Received from the SDK",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 24,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 4073,
   "end": 4128,
   "text": "- **Robot info**: Battery, location, speed from the SDK",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 25,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 4130,
   "end": 4196,
   "text": "You don't need to plug anything in - it all works through the SDK.",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 26,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 4198,
   "end": 4212,
   "text": "## Calibration",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 27,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 4214,
   "end": 4293,
   "text": "No calibration needed! The robot is ready to use as soon as the SDK is running.",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 28,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 4295,
   "end": 4319,
   "text": "## Controlling the Robot",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 29,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 4321,
   "end": 4411,
   "text": "You control the robot using your keyboard - just like playing a video game with WASD keys.",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 30,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 4413,
   "end": 4434,
   "text": "### Keyboard Controls",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 31,
   "kind": "table",
   "start": 4436,
   "end": 4478,
   "text": "| Key | Action                           |",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 32,
   "kind": "table",
   "start": 4522,
   "end": 4564,
   "text": "| W   | Move forward                     |",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 33,
   "kind": "table",
   "start": 4565,
   "end": 4607,
   "text": "| S   | Move backward                    |",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 34,
   "kind": "table",
   "start": 4608,
   "end": 4650,
   "text": "| A   | Turn left (with forward motion)  |",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 35,
   "kind": "table",
   "start": 4651,
   "end": 4693,
   "text": "| D   | Turn right (with forward motion) |",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 36,
   "kind": "table",
   "start": 4694,
   "end": 4736,
   "text": "| Q   | Rotate left in place             |",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 37,
   "kind": "table",
   "start": 4737,
   "end": 4779,
   "text": "| E   | Rotate right in place            |",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 38,
   "kind": "table",
   "start": 4780,
   "end": 4822,
   "text": "| X   | Stop all movement                |",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 39,
   "kind": "table",
   "start": 4823,
   "end": 4865,
   "text": "| +/= | Increase speed                   |",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 40,
   "kind": "table",
   "start": 4866,
   "end": 4908,
   "text": "| -   | Decrease speed                   |",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 41,
   "kind": "table",
   "start": 4909,
   "end": 4951,
   "text": "| ESC | Disconnect                       |",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 42,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 4953,
   "end": 4971,
   "text": "### Speed Settings",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 43,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 4973,
   "end": 5013,
   "text": "You can adjust how fast the robot moves:",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 44,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 5015,
   "end": 5072,
   "text": "- **Forward/backward speed**: Default is full speed (1.0)",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 45,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 5073,
   "end": 5121,
   "text": "- **Turning speed**: Default is full speed (1.0)",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 46,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 5122,
   "end": 5182,
   "text": "- **Speed changes**: Use +/- keys to adjust by 0.1 each time",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 47,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 5184,
   "end": 5198,
   "text": "### Try It Out",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 48,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 5200,
   "end": 5245,
   "text": "Test driving the robot before recording data:",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 49,
   "kind": "quote",
   "start": 5999,
   "end": 6215,
   "text": "> [!TIP]\n> If you're using a Mac, you might need to give Terminal permission to access your keyboard for teleoperation. Go to System Preferences > Security & Privacy > Input Monitoring and check the box for Terminal.",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 50,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 6217,
   "end": 6234,
   "text": "## Recording Data",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 51,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 6236,
   "end": 6339,
   "text": "Once you can drive the robot well, you can start recording data to train AI models. The system records:",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 52,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 6341,
   "end": 6411,
   "text": "- **What you do**: How you move the robot (forward, backward, turning)",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 53,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 6412,
   "end": 6438,
   "text": "- **What the robot sees**:",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 54,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 6439,
   "end": 6467,
   "text": "  - Videos from both cameras",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 55,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 6468,
   "end": 6497,
   "text": "  - Robot speed and direction",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 56,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 6498,
   "end": 6528,
   "text": "  - Battery level and location",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 57,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 6529,
   "end": 6556,
   "text": "  - GPS position and signal",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 58,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 6557,
   "end": 6578,
   "text": "  - Other sensor data",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 59,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 6579,
   "end": 6628,
   "text": "- **When it happened**: Timestamps for everything",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 60,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 6630,
   "end": 6657,
   "text": "### Setting Up Hugging Face",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 61,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 6659,
   "end": 6805,
   "text": "We use Hugging Face to store your data online. First, log in with your token from [Hugging Face settings](⟦0⟧):",
   "tokens": [
    "https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 62,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 6887,
   "end": 6920,
   "text": "Store your Hugging Face username:",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 63,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 7008,
   "end": 7027,
   "text": "### Start Recording",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 64,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 7029,
   "end": 7064,
   "text": "Use the standard recording command:",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 65,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 7476,
   "end": 7573,
   "text": "Replace ⟦0⟧ with your Hugging Face username and a name for your dataset.",
   "tokens": [
    "`your_username/dataset_name`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 66,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 7575,
   "end": 7594,
   "text": "### What Gets Saved",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 67,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 7596,
   "end": 7618,
   "text": "Your dataset includes:",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 68,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 7620,
   "end": 7650,
   "text": "**Your Actions (2 features)**:",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 69,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 7652,
   "end": 7708,
   "text": "- ⟦0⟧: How much you moved forward/backward",
   "tokens": [
    "`linear_velocity`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 70,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 7709,
   "end": 7761,
   "text": "- ⟦0⟧: How much you turned left/right",
   "tokens": [
    "`angular_velocity`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 71,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 7763,
   "end": 7800,
   "text": "**Robot Observations (24 features)**:",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 72,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 7802,
   "end": 7822,
   "text": "- Front camera video",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 73,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 7823,
   "end": 7842,
   "text": "- Rear camera video",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 74,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 7843,
   "end": 7858,
   "text": "- Current speed",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 75,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 7859,
   "end": 7874,
   "text": "- Battery level",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 76,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 7875,
   "end": 7888,
   "text": "- Orientation",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 77,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 7889,
   "end": 7933,
   "text": "- GPS (latitude, longitude, signal strength)",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 78,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 7934,
   "end": 7959,
   "text": "- Network signal strength",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 79,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 7960,
   "end": 7977,
   "text": "- Vibration level",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 80,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 7978,
   "end": 7999,
   "text": "- Lamp state (on/off)",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 81,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 8000,
   "end": 8025,
   "text": "- Accelerometer (x, y, z)",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 82,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 8026,
   "end": 8047,
   "text": "- Gyroscope (x, y, z)",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 83,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 8048,
   "end": 8072,
   "text": "- Magnetometer (x, y, z)",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 84,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 8073,
   "end": 8096,
   "text": "- Wheel RPMs (4 wheels)",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 85,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 8098,
   "end": 8122,
   "text": "### Where Your Data Goes",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 86,
   "kind": "para",
